# Inquiry form (/contact) delivery target.
# Each valid submission is POSTed here as JSON:
#   { text, type: "inquiry", submittedAt, locale, inquiryType: { id, label },
#     company, name, phone, email, message }
# `text` is a ready-to-read summary, so a Slack incoming-webhook URL works as-is;
# Make/Zapier/n8n or your own relay can use the structured fields.
# If this is unset or the endpoint does not answer 2xx, the form shows an error
# with the phone/email fallback instead of a success message.
CONTACT_WEBHOOK_URL=
